{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Ocean needs you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Descend into the depths as <strong>Lumara</strong>, a mutant anglerfish whose bioluminescent glow is the last beacon of hope in a world smothered by shadows and corruption.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Human pollution has poisoned the sea. Once-peaceful creatures have turned aggressive. Toxic waste chokes the water. And somewhere in the deepest darkness, something ancient waits.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Guided by the remnants of the Three Guardians of the Deep, uncover your purpose and discover hidden knowledge.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/extras/2dbada6914b499fe6306e1abdc2ef69c.poster.avif?t=1770896212\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/extras/2dbada6914b499fe6306e1abdc2ef69c.webm?t=1770896212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/extras/2dbada6914b499fe6306e1abdc2ef69c.mp4?t=1770896212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the light in the darkness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your glow isn't just for seeing, it's how you survive.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toggle your light</strong> to interact with creatures that react to brightness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reveal hidden passages</strong> that only appear under your glow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every creature responds differently. Some flee from brightness. Others attack when exposed. Learning what to illuminate and what to leave in darkness is the key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/extras/86ec5ecb4ea78b434d6dd971e6cd4093.poster.avif?t=1770896212\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/extras/86ec5ecb4ea78b434d6dd971e6cd4093.webm?t=1770896212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/extras/86ec5ecb4ea78b434d6dd971e6cd4093.mp4?t=1770896212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World Worth Saving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just about escape. It's about restoration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you can <strong>absorb toxic waste</strong>, <strong>seal pollution sources</strong>, and <strong>cleanse corrupted zones</strong>. Every action matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your cleanup progress directly shapes the ending</strong>. Rush through, and the restoration is weak. Take the time to heal the world, and witness the ocean return to its full glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>In Lumara, light is life, darkness is mystery, and the ocean holds secrets waiting to be discovered. Will you be its savior, or merely witness its final breath?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/extras/b361dac2b60bf241bc02060558734695.avif?t=1770896212\" width=1280 height=470 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537580?t=1770896212","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/31c5bd00950bbea5bde560b855ca1705d860fe46/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770896212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/32161266230c4b188cb2bb82e927e87a919702af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770896212","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/32161266230c4b188cb2bb82e927e87a919702af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770896212","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4064840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Ocean needs you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Descend into the depths as <strong>Lumara</strong>, a mutant anglerfish whose bioluminescent glow is the last beacon of hope in a world smothered by shadows and corruption.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Human pollution has poisoned the sea. Once-peaceful creatures have turned aggressive. Toxic waste chokes the water. And somewhere in the deepest darkness, something ancient waits.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Guided by the remnants of the Three Guardians of the Deep, uncover your purpose and discover hidden knowledge.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/extras/2dbada6914b499fe6306e1abdc2ef69c.poster.avif?t=1770896212\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/extras/2dbada6914b499fe6306e1abdc2ef69c.webm?t=1770896212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/extras/2dbada6914b499fe6306e1abdc2ef69c.mp4?t=1770896212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the light in the darkness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your glow isn't just for seeing, it's how you survive.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toggle your light</strong> to interact with creatures that react to brightness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reveal hidden passages</strong> that only appear under your glow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every creature responds differently. Some flee from brightness. Others attack when exposed. Learning what to illuminate and what to leave in darkness is the key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/extras/86ec5ecb4ea78b434d6dd971e6cd4093.poster.avif?t=1770896212\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/extras/86ec5ecb4ea78b434d6dd971e6cd4093.webm?t=1770896212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/extras/86ec5ecb4ea78b434d6dd971e6cd4093.mp4?t=1770896212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World Worth Saving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just about escape. It's about restoration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you can <strong>absorb toxic waste</strong>, <strong>seal pollution sources</strong>, and <strong>cleanse corrupted zones</strong>. Every action matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your cleanup progress directly shapes the ending</strong>. Rush through, and the restoration is weak. Take the time to heal the world, and witness the ocean return to its full glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>In Lumara, light is life, darkness is mystery, and the ocean holds secrets waiting to be discovered. Will you be its savior, or merely witness its final breath?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/extras/b361dac2b60bf241bc02060558734695.avif?t=1770896212\" width=1280 height=470 /></span></p>","developers":["Fabrizio Spadaro"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/71e0b9309c35e95b33129d56e9b5f9285dcd76d2/header.jpg?t=1770896212","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.13 High Sierra or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 Dual-Core @ 2.0 GHz or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Plus Graphics, AMD Radeon R9 M370X, or Apple M1 integrated GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Standard</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 Catalina or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 Quad-Core @ 2.7 GHz or Apple M1 / M2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon Pro 560 / Vega series, or Apple M1 Pro / M2 integrated GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Standard</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_traile