am/apps/3537580/6bb137d50f59b015fe7f52d7d741d852ae9268d8/ss_6bb137d50f59b015fe7f52d7d741d852ae9268d8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770896212","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/6bb137d50f59b015fe7f52d7d741d852ae9268d8/ss_6bb137d50f59b015fe7f52d7d741d852ae9268d8.600x338.jpg?t=1770896212"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/cd6d9c075f80e93bcf2f50ff4fa3ffdab5ebebcc/ss_cd6d9c075f80e93bcf2f50ff4fa3ffdab5ebebcc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770896212","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537580/cd6d9c075f80e93bcf2f50ff4fa3ffdab5ebebcc/ss_cd6d9c075f80e93bcf2f50ff4fa3ffdab5ebebcc.600x338.jpg?t=1770896212"}],"short_description":"Descend into a corrupted abyss as a light-wielding anglerfish in this haunting deep-sea adventure. Evade deadly predators, solve physics-based puzzles, uncover forgotten knowledge, and use your light to push back shadows and restore what was lost.","steam_appid":3537580,"support_info":{"email":"fabrizio@playlumara.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Japanese, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":null}